                "to changes while still filtering out noise.\n\n"
                "**Use cases**:\n"
                "- Smooth CPU usage readings to distinguish real load spikes from noise\n"
                "- Track the trend in response times to detect gradual degradation\n"
                "- Create a baseline for anomaly detection by comparing raw values to their "
                "EWMA\n\n"
                "Each record passes through enriched with `{field}_ewma` fields (e.g., "
                "`temperature_ewma`, `cpu_usage_ewma`)",
            "action_code": DPAT_PIPELINE_PROCESSOR,
